  "description": "U.S. Air Force pararescuemen conduct a mountainside search and rescue exercise, enabling training for North Atlantic contingency operations on land or at sea during exercise Northern Viking 26 (NV26) in Keflavik, Iceland, Aug. 31, 2026. NV26 strengthens interoperability and force readiness between the U.S., Iceland and Allied nations, enabling multi-domain command and control of joint and coalition forces in the defense of Iceland and sea lines of communication in the Greenland-Iceland-United Kingdom (GIUK) gap. (U.S. Navy Video by Mass Communication Specialist First Class Conor Martin)",
